    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-02-2021-october/q5",
      "question": "<p>The curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=5x^4-24x^3+42x^2-32x+11\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{\\mathrm dy}{\\mathrm dx}\"></span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{\\mathrm d^2y}{\\mathrm dx^2}\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol></li><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>Verify that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has a stationary point at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\"></span></li><li>Show that this stationary point is a point of inflection, giving reasons for your answer. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol></li></ol>",
